///
/// Usage:
///
/// ```sh
/// dart run bin/fah.dart [--model <id>] [--provider <kind>] [--base-url <url>]
///                       [--cwd <dir>] [--session-root <dir>]
/// dart run bin/fah.dart [options] "summarize the changelog"   # headless
/// dart run bin/fah.dart --prompt-file prompt.md               # from file
